r draw strength from the wounds you inflict?M��Timeline_StoryOption_901_Text拔出割脉刃Take the Vein-Cutting Blade[��Timeline_StoryOption_901_Result你将细刃收入行囊。You take the slender blade.=��Timeline_StoryOption_902_Text绕过石台Pass the altarc��Timeline_StoryOption_902_Result你让断刃留在原处。#You leave the blade where it rests.]��Timeline_StoryOption_1001_Text取疾风诀，出手更快Take Gale Art to strike faster��� Timeline_StoryOption_1001_Result'你记下了加快出手的吐纳法。;You learn a breathing technique that quickens your attacks.l��Timeline_StoryOption_1002_Text取饮血佩，以伤续命-Take the Blooddrinker Pendant to recover lifeb�� Timeline_StoryOption_1002_Result血玉入手微温。'The bloodstone feels warm in your hand.]��Timeline_StoryOption_1003_Text谢过药师，继续赶路Thank the apothecary and leavek�� Timeline_StoryOption_1003_Result你道别后继续前行。*You say farewell and continue on your way.